# Care labs (soon)

Do not build this yet unless asked. When working on `/care` Hair health, Action Plan, or treatment support, remember this planned follow-up.

## Product

- Optional **blood test / labs** in Care, in the spirit of Hims Labs.
- Show **blood values** in Hair health (or a linked labs surface).
- A **licensed physician personally reviews** the report and can add a **note on each value** explaining how it relates to that patient’s condition and treatment.
- Care **displays** those physician notes. Do not auto-match papers or thresholds to a patient’s number and call it “just research.”
- Tips stay next to the prescription, not instead of it. Do not auto-titrate minoxidil/finasteride from labs.

## Legal shape (Turkey — not legal advice)

- Testing via a **licensed Turkish lab**; Hiros is not the lab.
- Interpretation and per-value notes sit with the **treating physician**.
- Values are special-category health data (KVKK). Physician-in-the-loop, not an algorithm claiming a personal hair-loss conclusion.
